<title>AUSTRALIA: ASX substantial shareholding notices - April 28.</title>
<headline>ASX substantial shareholding notices - April 28.</headline>
<text>
<p>The following substantial shareholder notices have been made to The Australian Stock Exchange (ASX).</p>
<p>H M Fernbay Holdings Pty Ltd ceased to be a substantial shareholder in Century Drilling Limited on 25/11/1996.</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
<p>FMR Corporate became a substantial shareholder in Corporate Express Australia Limited on 18/04/1997 with a relevant interest in the issued ordinary share capital of 4,789,402 ordinary shares (5.22%).</p>
<p>- - - -</p>
</text>
